31. BUSINESS PROBLEM-SOLVING PATTERN
============================================================

A very important approach we've been practicing:

BUSINESS REQUIREMENT
        ↓
Identify the data
        ↓
Choose data structure
        ↓
Determine conditions
        ↓
Loop through data if needed
        ↓
Perform calculation
        ↓
Accumulate/count if needed
